---
import Head from '../../components/Head.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import TechList from '../../components/TechList.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Head title="My tech" description="A list of all the tech I own!"/>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>My <span class="accent">tech</span></h1>
      <a href="/">Go back</a>

      <p>This is a list of most items of tech I own!</p>
      <p>Some stuff in here doesn't work, however they can be fixed with a simple repair so I'm counting them anyway.</p>
      <p>This may not be everything, I don't have the time (or need) to go around my house and list everything off.</p>
      <p>This is a simplified version of the full list, which can be found <a href="/tech/full">here</a>.</p>
      <p class="extra-info">Last updated 31/08/2026.</p>
        
      <TechList version="simple" />
    </main>
    
    <Footer />
    <script src="https://pagering.gideon.sh/embed.js" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>